{
  "sn55.10:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 55.10 ",
  "sn55.10:0.2": "1. Veḷudvāravagga ",
  "sn55.10:0.3": "Tatiyagiñjakāvasathasutta ",
  "sn55.10:1.1": "Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho āyasmā ānando bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn55.10:1.2": "“kakkaṭo nāma, bhante, ñātike upāsako kālaṅkato; ",
  "sn55.10:1.3": "tassa kā gati, ko abhisamparāyo? ",
  "sn55.10:1.4": "Kaḷibho nāma, bhante, ñātike upāsako …pe… ",
  "sn55.10:1.5": "nikato nāma, bhante, ñātike upāsako … ",
  "sn55.10:1.6": "kaṭissaho nāma, bhante, ñātike upāsako … ",
  "sn55.10:1.7": "tuṭṭho nāma, bhante, ñātike upāsako … ",
  "sn55.10:1.8": "santuṭṭho nāma, bhante, ñātike upāsako … ",
  "sn55.10:1.9": "bhaddo nāma, bhante, ñātike upāsako … ",
  "sn55.10:1.10": "subhaddo nāma, bhante, ñātike upāsako kālaṅkato; ",
  "sn55.10:1.11": "tassa kā gati ko abhisamparāyo”ti? ",
  "sn55.10:2.1": "“Kakkaṭo, ānanda, upāsako kālaṅkato pañcannaṁ orambhāgiyānaṁ saṁyojanānaṁ parikkhayā opapātiko tattha parinibbāyī anāvattidhammo tasmā lokā. ",
  "sn55.10:2.2": "Kaḷibho, ānanda …pe… ",
  "sn55.10:2.3": "nikato, ānanda … ",
  "sn55.10:2.4": "kaṭissaho, ānanda … ",
  "sn55.10:2.5": "tuṭṭho, ānanda … ",
  "sn55.10:2.6": "santuṭṭho, ānanda … ",
  "sn55.10:2.7": "bhaddo, ānanda …pe… ",
  "sn55.10:2.8": "subhaddo, ānanda, upāsako kālaṅkato pañcannaṁ orambhāgiyānaṁ saṁyojanānaṁ parikkhayā opapātiko tattha parinibbāyī an